\/li><li>N\u00famero de drivers por auricular<\/li><li>1<\/li><li><b>Medidas<\/b><\/li><li>Peso del malet\u00edn de carga (oz)<\/li><li>1.4<\/li><li>Peso del auricular (oz)<\/li><li>0.3<\/li><li>Peso del malet\u00edn de carga (g)<\/li><li>39.3<\/li><li>Peso del auricular (g)<\/li><li>8.7<\/li><li><b>Caracter\u00edsticas de control y conexi\u00f3n<\/b><\/li><li>Perfiles Bluetooth<\/li><li>A2DP V1.3, AVRCP V1.6, HFP V1.7<\/li><li>Rango de frecuencia de transmisi\u00f3n Bluetooth<\/li><li>2.4 GHz &#8211; 2.4835 GHz<\/li><li>Transmisi\u00f3n de modulaci\u00f3n GFSK v\u00eda Bluetooth<\/li><li>GFSK, &#960;\/4DQPSK, 8DPSK<\/li><li>Potencia de transmisi\u00f3n Bluetooth<\/li><li>0 - 12dbm<\/li><li>Bater\u00eda<\/li><li>Tiempo de carga (horas)<\/li><li>2<\/li><li>Tiempo de juego m\u00e1ximo (horas)<\/li><li>20h (5h + 15h)<\/li><li><b>Caracter\u00edsticas<\/b><\/li><li>Bluetooth<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Charging cable<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Integraci\u00f3n con asistente de voz<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Micr\u00f3fono integrado<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Estuche de carga<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Earbud<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Llamadas con manos libres<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Bater\u00eda recargable<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>True Wireless<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Inal\u00e1mbrico<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li><b>Contenido de la caja<\/b><\/li><li>1 x par de auriculares JBL Wave 200TWS<\/li><li>1 x estuche de carga<\/li><li>1 x cable de carga USB tipo C<\/li><li>3 x tama\u00f1os de almohadilla<\/li><li>1 x garant\u00eda\/advertencia (W\/!)<\/li><li>1 x QSG\/hoja de seguridad (S\/i)<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"JBL","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.25