tel\u00e9fono inteligente, tableta o iPad, siempre que lo necesite.<\/p><h2>Cable de tela trenzada duradero<\/h2><p>Cuenta con un cable trenzado de 12 cm, resistente pero flexible.<\/p><p>\u00a1La sostenibilidad comienza con la durabilidad!<\/p><\/div><div><br><\/div><div><h2>Especificaciones<\/h2><p><ul><li><b>ALIMENTACI\u00d3N<\/b><\/li><li>Admite suministro de energ\u00eda USB-C de hasta 100 W<\/li><li><b>DISPOSITIVOS COMPATIBLES<\/b><\/li><li>MacBook Air\/Pro (M1, M1 Pro, M1 Max, M2 y con tecnolog\u00eda Intel) Admite iPad con puertos tipo C (iPad Pro 2018\/2020\/2021, iPad Air 2020\/2021\/2022, iPad mini 2020\/2021), tel\u00e9fonos m\u00f3viles y tablets con funci\u00f3n USB-C y DP, PC Windows y Chromebook con funci\u00f3n USB-C y DP, Samsung Dex, Nintendo Switch.<\/li><li><b>TIPO DE CONECTOR<\/b><\/li><li>Tipo C, compatible con Thunderbolt 4 y versiones inferiores<\/li><li><b>DIMENSI\u00d3N Y PESO<\/b><\/li><li>6,6 cm x 2,8 cm x 1,0 cm, 26,5 g<\/li><li><b>VELOCIDAD<\/b><\/li><li>USB-A 3.2 Gen1 hasta 5 Gbps.<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><\/div>                                                                                        ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"LINQ","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":25.23,"unit_price_tax":25.23,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cables","sub_category":"Cables HDMI","quantity":0,"brand":"LINQ","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_liq-cab%20lq48000_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":20.23}}},"5706662207997":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["5706662207997",false],"wholesale_price":[25.29,false],"price":[30.29,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 